---
---

<div class="cs-quickstart-bar not-content">
  <div class="cs-qs-top">
    <span class="cs-qs-label">2-Call Mental Model (<code>struct</code> + <code>.from()</code> &mdash; 0 Dependencies, No Proxy, No Build Plugin)</span>
    <div class="cs-qs-actions">
      <button type="button" class="cs-qs-btn cs-qs-cmd" id="cs-btn-copy-npm" title="Copy install command">
        <code>$ npm i capnstruct</code>
        <span class="cs-qs-badge" id="cs-npm-status">Copy</span>
      </button>
      <button type="button" class="cs-qs-btn cs-qs-llm" id="cs-btn-copy-llm" title="Copy 400-token capnstruct ruleset for Claude Code, Cursor, or Windsurf">
        <span>&#x1F916; Copy LLM Prompt (<code>llms.txt</code>)</span>
        <span class="cs-qs-badge cs-qs-badge-accent" id="cs-llm-status">Claude / Cursor</span>
      </button>
      <a href="/llms.txt" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="cs-qs-link"><code>/llms.txt</code> &nearr;</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <pre class="cs-qs-code"><code><span class="cs-kw">const</span> Particle = <span class="cs-fn">struct</span>(&#123; x: f32, y: f32, vx: f32, vy: f32 &#125;);
<span class="cs-kw">const</span> list = Particle.<span class="cs-fn">from</span>(bytesOrObjects); <span class="cs-cm">// pack plain JS objects OR O(1) zero-copy wrap Uint8Array / SharedArrayBuffer</span>
<span class="cs-kw">for</span> (<span class="cs-kw">const</span> p <span class="cs-kw">of</span> list) p.x += p.vx;          <span class="cs-cm">// mutates #[repr(C)] binary buffer in-place (0 heap allocs)</span></code></pre>
</div>

<div class="cs-playground not-content">
  <!-- SECTION 1: 3 SIDE-BY-SIDE LIVE 60FPS ANIMATIONS + SCALING GRAPHS (NO TABS REQUIRED) -->
  <div class="cs-panel active" id="cs-panel-bench">
    <div class="cs-panel-header cs-panel-header-stack">
      <div class="cs-header-top">
        <strong class="cs-panel-title">1. Interactive Particle Vortex &amp; 60 FPS Visual Proof: Drag Your Cursor Across the Canvases</strong>
        <p class="cs-sub">
          Move or drag your cursor across any canvas below to swirl particles &amp; query cyclic <code>ref(self)</code> graphs in real time. Toggle between <strong>All 3 Side-by-Side</strong> or isolate <strong>Standard JS / Bun (GC Stutter)</strong> vs. <strong>capnstruct #[repr(C)] (Locked 60/120 FPS, 0.00 MB Heap)</strong> to feel the cursor hitch during GC pauses vs. zero-copy shared memory.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Interactive Parameter Bar (Anti-Cherry-Pick Controls) -->
      <div class="cs-param-bar">
        <div class="cs-param-controls">
          <div class="cs-param-item">
            <span class="cs-param-label">Interactive View:</span>
            <div class="cs-pill-group" id="cs-focus-group">
              <button class="cs-mini-btn active" data-focus="all">All 3 Side-by-Side</button>
              <button class="cs-mini-btn" data-focus="v8">&#x1F7E0; Standard JS / Bun (GC Hitch)</button>
              <button class="cs-mini-btn" data-focus="jsc">&#x1F980; Rust -O3 (JSON FFI)</button>
              <button class="cs-mini-btn" data-focus="capn">&#9889; capnstruct (Locked 60/120 FPS)</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="cs-param-item">
          <span class="cs-param-label">Dataset Scale (N):</span>
          <div class="cs-pill-group" id="cs-scale-group">
            <button class="cs-mini-btn" data-scale="2500">2.5k</button>
            <button class="cs-mini-btn" data-scale="10000">10k</button>
            <button class="cs-mini-btn active" data-scale="25000">25k</button>
            <button class="cs-mini-btn" data-scale="50000">50k</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="cs-param-item">
          <label class="cs-param-label" for="cs-sel-slider">
            Filter Hit Rate: <strong id="cs-sel-val" class="cs-sel-val-num">4%</strong>
          </label>
          <input id="cs-sel-slider" type="range" min="1" max="100" value="4" class="cs-slider" />
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="cs-live-hud">
        <span class="cs-hud-badge cs-hud-fps" id="cs-hud-fps">
          Sweeps: <span class="cs-hud-num" id="cs-sw-capn">0</span> vs <span class="cs-hud-num" id="cs-sw-rust">0</span> (Rust) vs <span class="cs-hud-num" id="cs-sw-bun">0</span> (Bun)
        </span>
        <span class="cs-hud-badge cs-hud-ms" id="cs-hud-ms">0.17ms vs 3.7ms (Rust) vs 5.7ms (Bun)</span>
        <span class="cs-hud-badge cs-hud-heap" id="cs-hud-heap">0.00 MB vs +6.9 MB GC</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <!-- 3 SIDE-BY-SIDE LIVE ANIMATIONS (NO TAB SWITCHING) -->
    <div class="cs-trio-grid">
      <div class="cs-canvas-wrap cs-card-v8">
        <div class="cs-canvas-title">
          <span class="cs-canvas-label">&#x1F7E0; 1. Bun JSC (~2x vs Node V8)</span>
          <span class="cs-canvas-hint cs-hint-v8" id="cs-hint-v8">5.7 ms (V8: 14.1 ms) &middot; +6.9 MB GC!</span>
        </div>
        <canvas id="cs-anim-v8" class="cs-anim-canvas" width="310" height="270"></canvas>
      </div>
      <div class="cs-canvas-wrap cs-card-jsc">
        <div class="cs-canvas-title">
          <span class="cs-canvas-label">&#x1F980; 2. Rust -O3 WASM (JSON / FFI)</span>
          <span class="cs-canvas-hint cs-hint-jsc" id="cs-hint-jsc">3.7 ms JSON / 23.0 ms FFI</span>
        </div>
        <canvas id="cs-anim-jsc" class="cs-anim-canvas" width="310" height="270"></canvas>
      </div>
      <div class="cs-canvas-wrap cs-card-capn">
        <div class="cs-canvas-title">
          <span class="cs-canvas-label">&#9889; 3. capnstruct #[repr(C)] (45x-198x)</span>
          <span class="cs-canvas-hint cs-hint-capn" id="cs-hint-capn">0.17 ms JS / 0.07 ms WASM &middot; 0 MB</span>
        </div>
        <canvas id="cs-anim-capn" class="cs-anim-canvas" width="310" height="270"></canvas>
      </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ALL 3 VISUAL GRAPHS & LIVE BENCHMARK LAID OUT DIRECTLY (NO SUB-TABS) -->
      <div class="cs-graph-section">
        <div class="cs-graph-header">
          <strong class="cs-section-subhead">&#x1F4C8; Scaling Curve (N = 100 &rarr; 100,000) &amp; Filter Selectivity (0.5% &rarr; 100% Decode)</strong>
          <button id="cs-run-bench" class="cs-btn cs-btn-primary">&#9654; Run Live Browser Benchmark</button>
        </div>
        <div class="cs-gpanel active" id="cs-gpanel-scale">
          <div class="cs-graph-card">
            <div class="cs-graph-legend">
              <span class="cs-leg-item"><i class="cs-dot cs-dot-v8"></i> Node.js v24 (V8) JSON / Clone</span>
              <span class="cs-leg-item"><i class="cs-dot cs-dot-jsc"></i> Bun v1.4 (JavaScriptCore)</span>
              <span class="cs-leg-item"><i class="cs-dot cs-dot-rust"></i> Rust -O3 (WASM JSON Parse)</span>
              <span class="cs-leg-item"><i class="cs-dot cs-dot-capn"></i> <strong>capnstruct #[repr(C)] (JS &amp; Rust, 0 MB)</strong></span>
              <span class="cs-leg-item"><i class="cs-dot cs-dot-inmem"></i> Already-In-Memory JS Array (No Parse)</span>
            </div>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 860 270" class="cs-svg-chart" role="img" aria-label="Scaling curve comparing Node.js V8, Bun JSC, Rust WASM, and capnstruct from N=100 to N=100,000 rows">
              <!-- Grid & Axes -->
              <line x1="70" y1="25" x2="820" y2="25" stroke="currentColor" stroke-opacity="0.08" />
              <line x1="70" y1="75" x2="820" y2="75" stroke="currentColor" stroke-opacity="0.08" />
              <line x1="70" y1="125" x2="820" y2="125" stroke="currentColor" stroke-opacity="0.08" />
              <line x1="70" y1="175" x2="820" y2="175" stroke="currentColor" stroke-opacity="0.08" />
              <line x1="70" y1="220" x2="820" y2="220" stroke="currentColor" stroke-opacity="0.25" />
              <line x1="70" y1="25" x2="70" y2="220" stroke="currentColor" stroke-opacity="0.25" />

              <!-- 16.6ms (60 FPS) & 8.3ms (120 FPS) Frame Budget Threshold Lines -->
              <line x1="70" y1="104" x2="820" y2="104" stroke="#ef4444" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="6,4" stroke-opacity="0.75" />
              <text x="815" y="98" text-anchor="end" font-size="11" fill="#ef4444" font-weight="600">16.6 ms &ndash; 60 FPS Frame Budget Ceiling (Stutter Zone Above)</text>
              <line x1="70" y1="162" x2="820" y2="162" stroke="#f59e0b" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-dasharray="4,4" stroke-opacity="0.65" />
              <text x="815" y="156" text-anchor="end" font-size="10.5" fill="#f59e0b">8.3 ms &ndash; 120 FPS Frame Budget</text>

              <!-- Y-Axis Labels (0 ms to 28 ms) -->
              <text x="62" y="29" text-anchor="end" font-size="11" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.7">28 ms</text>
              <text x="62" y="79" text-anchor="end" font-size="11" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.7">21 ms</text>
              <text x="62" y="129" text-anchor="end" font-size="11" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.7">14 ms</text>
              <text x="62" y="179" text-anchor="end" font-size="11" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.7">7 ms</text>
              <text x="62" y="224" text-anchor="end" font-size="11" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.7">0 ms</text>

              <!-- X-Axis Scale Points: N = 100, 1k, 5k, 10k, 25k, 50k, 100k -->
              <text x="90" y="242" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.8">N=100</text>
              <text x="205" y="242" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.8">1,000</text>
              <text x="320" y="242" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.8">5,000</text>
              <text x="435" y="242" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.8">10,000</text>
              <text x="550" y="242" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.8">25,000</text>
              <text x="665" y="242" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.8">50,000</text>
              <text x="785" y="242" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.8">100,000</text>

              <!-- Shaded Gap Between Rust/Bun JSON and Data Layout Change (capnstruct) -->
              <polygon points="90,219.8 205,219.6 320,218.8 435,217.7 550,213.5 665,207.0 785,194.0 785,218.9 665,219.2 550,219.6 435,219.9 320,219.9 205,220 90,220" fill="#10b981" fill-opacity="0.09" />

              <!-- Curve 1: Node.js v24 (V8) structuredClone / Wire Parse (0.034 -> 0.26 -> 1.27 -> 2.58 -> 6.60 -> 13.79 -> 27.85 ms) -->
              <polyline fill="none" stroke="#ef4444" stroke-width="3" points="90,219.7 205,218.2 320,211.1 435,202.0 550,173.8 665,123.5 785,25.1" />
              <circle cx="90" cy="219.7" r="4" fill="#ef4444" /><circle cx="205" cy="218.2" r="4" fill="#ef4444" /><circle cx="320" cy="211.1" r="4" fill="#ef4444" /><circle cx="435" cy="202.0" r="4" fill="#ef4444" /><circle cx="550" cy="173.8" r="4" fill="#ef4444" /><circle cx="665" cy="123.5" r="4" fill="#ef4444" /><circle cx="785" cy="25.1" r="5" fill="#ef4444" />
              <text x="772" y="38" text-anchor="end" font-size="11" font-weight="700" fill="#ef4444">Node V8: 27.8 ms (+10.3 MB heap)</text>

              <!-- Curve 2: Bun v1.4 (JSC) Engine Switch (0.035 -> 0.14 -> 0.62 -> 1.28 -> 3.28 -> 6.68 -> 13.85 ms) -->
              <polyline fill="none" stroke="#f59e0b" stroke-width="3" points="90,219.7 205,219.0 320,215.7 435,211.0 550,197.0 665,173.3 785,123.0" />
              <circle cx="90" cy="219.7" r="4" fill="#f59e0b" /><circle cx="205" cy="219.0" r="4" fill="#f59e0b" /><circle cx="320" cy="215.7" r="4" fill="#f59e0b" /><circle cx="435" cy="211.0" r="4" fill="#f59e0b" /><circle cx="550" cy="197.0" r="4" fill="#f59e0b" /><circle cx="665" cy="173.3" r="4" fill="#f59e0b" /><circle cx="785" cy="123.0" r="5" fill="#f59e0b" />
              <text x="772" y="116" text-anchor="end" font-size="11" font-weight="700" fill="#f59e0b">Bun JSC: 13.9 ms (2x faster, +6.9 MB heap)</text>

              <!-- Curve 3: Rust -O3 WASM JSON Parse (0.004 -> 0.034 -> 0.167 -> 0.337 -> 0.931 -> 1.862 -> 3.73 ms in-WASM, 23.0 ms w/ JS FFI) -->
              <polyline fill="none" stroke="#a855f7" stroke-width="2.6" points="90,219.8 205,219.8 320,218.8 435,217.7 550,213.5 665,207.0 785,194.0" />
              <circle cx="90" cy="219.8" r="3.5" fill="#a855f7" /><circle cx="205" cy="219.8" r="3.5" fill="#a855f7" /><circle cx="320" cy="218.8" r="3.5" fill="#a855f7" /><circle cx="435" cy="217.7" r="3.5" fill="#a855f7" /><circle cx="550" cy="213.5" r="3.5" fill="#a855f7" /><circle cx="665" cy="207.0" r="3.5" fill="#a855f7" /><circle cx="785" cy="194.0" r="4.5" fill="#a855f7" />
              <text x="772" y="187" text-anchor="end" font-size="11" font-weight="700" fill="#a855f7">Rust -O3 JSON: 3.73 ms (23.0 ms w/ JS FFI)</text>

              <!-- Curve 4: Already-In-Memory Plain JS Loop (Dashed reference: 0.002 -> 0.12 ms) -->
              <polyline fill="none" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-dasharray="3,3" points="90,219.9 205,219.9 320,219.9 435,219.9 550,219.7 665,219.5 785,219.1" />

              <!-- Curve 5: capnstruct #[repr(C)] Contiguous Layout (0.0002 -> 0.17 ms JS / 0.073 ms Rust -O3) -->
              <polyline fill="none" stroke="#10b981" stroke-width="3.5" points="90,219.9 205,219.9 320,219.9 435,219.9 550,219.6 665,219.2 785,218.9" />
              <circle cx="90" cy="219.9" r="4" fill="#10b981" /><circle cx="205" cy="219.9" r="4" fill="#10b981" /><circle cx="320" cy="219.9" r="4" fill="#10b981" /><circle cx="435" cy="219.9" r="4" fill="#10b981" /><circle cx="550" cy="219.6" r="4" fill="#10b981" /><circle cx="665" cy="219.2" r="4" fill="#10b981" /><circle cx="785" cy="218.9" r="5.5" fill="#10b981" />
            <text x="772" y="213" text-anchor="end" font-size="11.5" font-weight="800" fill="#10b981">capnstruct #[repr(C)]: 0.17 ms JS / 0.08 ms Go·TinyGo / 0.07 ms Rust</text>

              <text x="95" y="198" font-size="10" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.65">At N=100, all meet (~0.02ms)</text>
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- GRAPH 2: FILTER SELECTIVITY SWEEP SVG (0.5% -> 100% Hit Rate on 25,000 13-Field Telemetry Rows) -->
        <div class="cs-gpanel active" id="cs-gpanel-selectivity">
          <div class="cs-graph-card">
            <div class="cs-graph-legend">
              <span class="cs-leg-item"><i class="cs-dot cs-dot-v8"></i> Node V8 (<code>JSON.parse</code> + filter)</span>
              <span class="cs-leg-item"><i class="cs-dot cs-dot-jsc"></i> Bun JSC (<code>JSON.parse</code> + filter)</span>
              <span class="cs-leg-item"><i class="cs-dot cs-dot-rust"></i> Rust -O3 (JSON Scan + filter)</span>
              <span class="cs-leg-item"><i class="cs-dot cs-dot-capn"></i> <strong>capnstruct #[repr(C)] (JS: 0.29ms / Rust: 0.018ms)</strong></span>
              <span class="cs-leg-item"><i class="cs-dot cs-dot-inmem"></i> Already-Parsed In-Memory JS Objects (No Wire Parse)</span>
            </div>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 860 260" class="cs-svg-chart" role="img" aria-label="Filter selectivity curve from 0.5% to 100% hit rate on 25,000 flight telemetry records">
              <line x1="70" y1="30" x2="820" y2="30" stroke="currentColor" stroke-opacity="0.08" />
              <line x1="70" y1="80" x2="820" y2="80" stroke="currentColor" stroke-opacity="0.08" />
              <line x1="70" y1="130" x2="820" y2="130" stroke="currentColor" stroke-opacity="0.08" />
              <line x1="70" y1="180" x2="820" y2="180" stroke="currentColor" stroke-opacity="0.08" />
              <line x1="70" y1="215" x2="820" y2="215" stroke="currentColor" stroke-opacity="0.25" />
              <line x1="70" y1="30" x2="70" y2="215" stroke="currentColor" stroke-opacity="0.25" />

              <text x="62" y="34" text-anchor="end" font-size="11" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.7">16 ms</text>
              <text x="62" y="84" text-anchor="end" font-size="11" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.7">12 ms</text>
              <text x="62" y="134" text-anchor="end" font-size="11" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.7">8 ms</text>
              <text x="62" y="184" text-anchor="end" font-size="11" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.7">4 ms</text>
              <text x="62" y="219" text-anchor="end" font-size="11" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.7">0 ms</text>

              <!-- X-Axis Selectivity Points: 0.5%, 5%, 25%, 50%, 100% of 25,000 rows matched & UTF-8 string decoded -->
              <text x="110" y="238" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.8">0.5% Hit (125 rows)</text>
              <text x="275" y="238" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.8">5% Hit (1,250)</text>
              <text x="445" y="238" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.8">25% Hit (6,250)</text>
              <text x="615" y="238" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.8">50% Hit (12,500)</text>
              <text x="775" y="238" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.8">100% Hit (All 25,000!)</text>

              <!-- Node V8 JSON.parse + filter: ~14.2-15.4 ms across all hit rates -->
              <polyline fill="none" stroke="#ef4444" stroke-width="3" points="110,36.5 275,55.3 445,46.6 615,51.2 775,51.2" />
              <circle cx="110" cy="36.5" r="4" fill="#ef4444" /><circle cx="275" cy="55.3" r="4" fill="#ef4444" /><circle cx="445" cy="46.6" r="4" fill="#ef4444" /><circle cx="615" cy="51.2" r="4" fill="#ef4444" /><circle cx="775" cy="51.2" r="5" fill="#ef4444" />
              <text x="770" y="42" text-anchor="end" font-size="11" font-weight="700" fill="#ef4444">Node V8 JSON.parse: ~14.2 ms everywhere (+8.2 MB heap)</text>

              <!-- Bun JSC JSON.parse + filter: ~5.6-6.3 ms across all hit rates -->
              <polyline fill="none" stroke="#f59e0b" stroke-width="3" points="110,141.9 275,143.8 445,150.2 615,149.7 775,148.7" />
              <circle cx="110" cy="141.9" r="4" fill="#f59e0b" /><circle cx="275" cy="143.8" r="4" fill="#f59e0b" /><circle cx="445" cy="150.2" r="4" fill="#f59e0b" /><circle cx="615" cy="149.7" r="4" fill="#f59e0b" /><circle cx="775" cy="148.7" r="5" fill="#f59e0b" />
              <text x="770" y="139" text-anchor="end" font-size="11" font-weight="700" fill="#f59e0b">Bun JSC JSON.parse: ~5.7 ms everywhere (+5.2 MB heap)</text>

              <!-- Rust -O3 JSON Scan + filter: 4.16 ms everywhere (must scan all JSON text) -->
              <polyline fill="none" stroke="#a855f7" stroke-width="2.6" points="110,166.9 275,166.8 445,166.7 615,166.5 775,166.2" />
              <circle cx="110" cy="166.9" r="3.5" fill="#a855f7" /><circle cx="275" cy="166.8" r="3.5" fill="#a855f7" /><circle cx="445" cy="166.7" r="3.5" fill="#a855f7" /><circle cx="615" cy="166.5" r="3.5" fill="#a855f7" /><circle cx="775" cy="166.2" r="4.5" fill="#a855f7" />
              <text x="770" y="161" text-anchor="end" font-size="11" font-weight="700" fill="#a855f7">Rust -O3 JSON Scan: ~4.16 ms everywhere (must scan all JSON text)</text>

              <!-- capnstruct Zero-Copy Filter + UTF-8 Decode: 0.34ms (0.5%) -> 0.38ms (5%) -> 0.67ms (25%) -> 0.70ms (50%) -> 1.19ms (100%); Rust #[repr(C)]: 0.018ms -> 0.17ms -->
              <polyline fill="none" stroke="#10b981" stroke-width="3.5" points="110,211.0 275,210.6 445,207.2 615,206.9 775,201.2" />
              <circle cx="110" cy="211.0" r="4" fill="#10b981" /><circle cx="275" cy="210.6" r="4" fill="#10b981" /><circle cx="445" cy="207.2" r="4" fill="#10b981" /><circle cx="615" cy="206.9" r="4" fill="#10b981" /><circle cx="775" cy="201.2" r="5.5" fill="#10b981" />
              <text x="770" y="193" text-anchor="end" font-size="11.5" font-weight="800" fill="#10b981">capnstruct: 0.29 ms JS / 0.018 ms Rust (1.19 ms JS / 0.17 ms Rust at 100%!)</text>

              <!-- Already-Parsed In-Memory JS Objects (Dashed reference: ~0.08 ms) -->
              <polyline fill="none" stroke="#94a3b8" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-dasharray="3,3" points="110,214.0 275,214.4 445,214.1 615,214.3 775,214.2" />
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>

      <!-- GRAPH 3: LIVE BROWSER BENCHMARK BARS -->
      <div class="cs-gpanel active" id="cs-gpanel-livebars">
        <div class="cs-graph-header" style="margin-top: 0.9rem;">
          <strong class="cs-section-subhead">&#x1F525; 4 Real-World Developer Pain Points (Click "Run Live Browser Benchmark" Above to Measure on Your CPU)</strong>
        </div>
        <div id="cs-bench-results" class="cs-bench-grid">
          <div class="cs-bench-card" data-bench="scan">
            <div class="cs-bench-top">
              <span class="cs-pain-tag">PAIN POINT #1 &middot; GC PAUSES &amp; HEAP BLOAT</span>
              <div class="cs-bench-title">100,000-Row Telemetry Scan (5.27 MiB JSON vs 2.29 MiB <code>#[repr(C)]</code>)</div>
              <div class="cs-bench-desc"><code>JSON.parse()</code> allocates 100,000 V8 heap objects (<strong>+10.3 MB</strong>, triggering GC stalls). <code>capnstruct</code> scans a flat <code>Uint8Array</code> in place (<strong>0 allocations</strong>):</div>
            </div>
            <div class="cs-bench-bottom">
              <div class="cs-bars">
                <div class="cs-bar-row">
                  <span class="cs-bar-label">JSON.parse (+10.3 MB)</span>
