      <div class="cs-how-grid">
        <div class="cs-how-card">
          <strong>1. Shorter / Equal Edit (<code>0 Allocs</code>)</strong>
          <span>Overwrites UTF-8 bytes or slice elements directly inside the existing slot; records reclaimed bytes in <code>.compactionRatio</code>.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="cs-how-card">
          <strong>2. Longer Edit (<code>Tail Append</code>)</strong>
          <span>Extends in place if at the tail tip (<code>0 dead bytes</code>), or bump-allocates at the tail end and updates the 8-byte <code>[u32 relOff, u32 len]</code> pointer.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="cs-how-card">
          <strong>3. <code>.compact()</code> (<code>Wire Ready</code>)</strong>
          <span>Strips dead tail bytes in a single pass and rebinds the view in-place before sending over WebSocket / RPC.</span>
        </div>
